==English==

===Adverb===
'''[[like]] [[a]] [[headless]] [[chicken]]'''

# {{simile}} To act in a [[haphazard]] or [[aimless]] way; [[frantically]] or without [[control]].
#: ''The president doesn't know what to do. He's running around '''like a headless chicken'''.''

